REGEDIT4

; Makes Windows keep a full memory dump when SRDemo.exe crashes, in
; %LOCALAPPDATA%\CrashDumps. Even crashes that skip every handler in the
; program (a fail-fast, code C0000409) produce one. Double-click to import
; (needs administrator rights). tools\disable_crashdumps.reg removes it.

[HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\SOFTWARE\Microsoft\Windows\Windows Error Reporting\LocalDumps\SRDemo.exe]
"DumpType"=dword:00000002
"DumpCount"=dword:00000005
